msgid "Calls"
msgstr "ການໂທ"

#: data/org.gnome.Calls.desktop.in:3 data/org.gnome.Calls-daemon.desktop.in:3
msgid "Phone"
msgstr "ໂທລະສັບ"

#: data/org.gnome.Calls.desktop.in:4
msgid "A phone dialer and call handler"
msgstr "ຕົວໝາຍເລກໂທລະສັບ ແລະ ຕົວຈັດການການໂທ"

#. Translators: Search terms to find this application. Do NOT translate or localize the semicolons! The list MUST also end with a semicolon!
#: data/org.gnome.Calls.desktop.in:6 data/org.gnome.Calls-daemon.desktop.in:6
msgid "Telephone;Call;Phone;Dial;Dialer;PSTN;"
msgstr "Telephone;Call;Phone;Dial;Dialer;PSTN;ໂທລະສັບ;ການໂທ;ໝາຍເລກ;ແປ້ນໂທ;"

#: data/org.gnome.Calls-daemon.desktop.in:2
msgid "Calls (daemon)"
msgstr "ການໂທ (ດິມອນ)"

#: data/org.gnome.Calls-daemon.desktop.in:4
msgid "A phone dialer and call handler (daemon mode)"
msgstr "ຕົວໝາຍເລກໂທລະສັບ ແລະ ຕົວຈັດການການໂທ (ໂໝດດິມອນ)"

#: data/org.gnome.Calls.metainfo.xml.in:7
msgid "Make phone and SIP calls"
msgstr "ໂທອອກຜ່ານໂທລະສັບ ແລະ SIP"

#: data/org.gnome.Calls.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"Calls is a simple, elegant phone dialer and call handler for GNOME. It can "
"be used with a cellular modem for plain old telephone calls as well as VoIP "
"calls using the SIP protocol."
msgstr ""
"ການໂທ ເປັນຕົວໝາຍເລກໂທລະສັບ ແລະ ຕົວຈັດການການໂທທີ່ລຽບງ່າຍ ແລະ ສວຍງາມສຳລັບ GNOME. "
"ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບໂມເດັມມືຖືສຳລັບການໂທລະສັບທົ່ວໄປ ລວມທັງການໂທ VoIP ຜ່ານໂປຣໂຕຄໍ SIP."

#. developer_name tag deprecated with Appstream 1.0
#: data/org.gnome.Calls.metainfo.xml.in:25
msgid "Julian Sparber, Evangelos Ribeiro Tzaras"
msgstr "Julian Sparber, Evangelos Ribeiro Tzaras"

#. Translators: A screenshot description.
#: data/org.gnome.Calls.metainfo.xml.in:33
msgid "Placing a call"
msgstr "ກຳລັງໂທອອກ"

#. Translators: A screenshot description.
#: data/org.gnome.Calls.metainfo.xml.in:38
msgid "The call history"
msgstr "ປະຫວັດການໂທ"

#: data/org.gnome.Calls.gschema.xml:7 data/org.gnome.Calls.gschema.xml:8
msgid "Whether calls should automatically use the default origin"
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າການໂທຄວນໃຊ້ແຫຼ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼືບໍ່"

#: data/org.gnome.Calls.gschema.xml:13
msgid "The country code as reported by the modem"
msgstr "ລະຫັດປະເທດຕາມທີ່ໂມເດັມລາຍງານ"

#: data/org.gnome.Calls.gschema.xml:14
msgid "The country code is used for contact name lookup"
msgstr "ລະຫັດປະເທດຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາຊື່ຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່"

#: data/org.gnome.Calls.gschema.xml:19
msgid "The plugins to load automatically"
msgstr "ປລັກອິນທີ່ຈະໂຫລດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: data/org.gnome.Calls.gschema.xml:20
msgid "These plugins will be automatically loaded on application startup."
msgstr "ປລັກອິນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກໂຫລດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ."

#: data/org.gnome.Calls.gschema.xml:25
msgid "Audio codecs to use for VoIP calls in order of preference"
msgstr "Audio codecs ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບການໂທ VoIP ຕາມລຳດັບຄວາມມັກ"

#: data/org.gnome.Calls.gschema.xml:26
msgid "The preferred audio codecs to use for VoIP calls (if available)"
msgstr "Audio codecs ທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ສຳລັບການໂທ VoIP (ຖ້າມີ)"

#: data/org.gnome.Calls.gschema.xml:31
msgid "Allow insecure crypto key exchange for encrypted media."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແລກປ່ຽນຄີເຂົ້າລະຫັດທີ່ບໍ່ປອດໄພສຳລັບສື່ທີ່ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດ."

#: data/org.gnome.Calls.gschema.xml:32
msgid ""
"Set to true if you want to allow keys to be exchangable in cleartext, "
"otherwise you must set the TLS transport."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງເປັນ 'ຈິງ' ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ແລກປ່ຽນຄີເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າການສົ່ງຜ່ານ TLS."

